# RAG Project Structure

## Module responsibilities

| Module | Responsibility | Do not put here |
|--------|----------------|-----------------|
| `config.py` | Env vars, settings | Business logic |
| `ingestion/loader.py` | Load raw files → Documents | Embedding or DB calls |
| `ingestion/pipeline.py` | Split → embed → store | Query/retrieval logic |
| `retrieval/vector_store.py` | MongoDB + Voyage setup | Prompt templates |
| `chains/rag.py` | LCEL RAG chain only | File I/O |
| `cli.py` | Typer commands | Core logic (delegate to modules) |

## Extension guidelines

- Add new document sources in `ingestion/loader.py`
- Change chunking in `ingestion/pipeline.py` or `config.py`
- Add retriever filters in `retrieval/vector_store.py`
- Change prompts in `chains/rag.py`
- Write unit tests in `tests/unit/` before implementation

## Approved stack

- Embeddings: `VoyageAIEmbeddings` (manual, client-side)
- Vector store: `MongoDBAtlasVectorSearch`
- LLM: `ChatOpenAI`
- Tests: `pytest` with `@pytest.mark.integration` for Atlas tests
